abstract: >-
  Benchmark SNAC vs EnCodec round-trip reconstruction on telephony-degraded
  speech (FLEURS + noisekit). Reports STOI, narrowband PESQ at 8 kHz, SNR,
  and encode/decode latency on GPU. Colab notebook and published baseline
  results included.
